{"id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-godel-encoding.md","title":"Effective Gödel Numbering","display":"df-godel-encoding — Effective Gödel Numbering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-godel-encoding","aliases":["67-df-godel-encoding"],"display":"df-godel-encoding — Effective Gödel Numbering","depends_on":["[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-expression]]","[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"Gödel numbering; Fact 4","source_printed_pages":"9–10","source_pdf_pages":"20–21","source_proof_status":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","input_verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","input_source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","revision_status":"locally-revised"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-godel-encoding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-godel-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-encoding — Effective Gödel Numbering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca49afa2dba90443\" href=\"?note=ca49afa2dba90443\" title=\"67-df-expression\">67-df-expression</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Gödel numbering; Fact 4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"9–10"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"20–21"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是固定有效有限字母表语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Expr}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\)</span>、公式及项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca49afa2dba90443\" href=\"?note=ca49afa2dba90443\" title=\"67-df-expression\">67-df-expression</a>。固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的符号编号及有限树编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_L\">\\(c_L\\)</span>，下式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=c_L\">\\(c=c_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\">\\(c[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\\)</span> 是递归集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(e,d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为候选编码变换和反变换。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_L(g;e,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_L(g;e,d)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_L(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_L(g)\\)</span> 是下式定义的编号谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{in}_{0,L},\\mathrm{in}_{1,L},\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}\">\\(\\mathrm{in}_{0,L},\\mathrm{in}_{1,L},\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca49afa2dba90443\" href=\"?note=ca49afa2dba90443\" title=\"67-df-expression\">67-df-expression</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_L^{\\mathrm{tm}},g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}},g_L^{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(g_L^{\\mathrm{tm}},g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}},g_L^{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 是下式定义的带类型编号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{decF}_{L,g}\">\\(\\operatorname{decF}_{L,g}\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\)</span> 时定义，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_L]\">\\(g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_L]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对项、公式和有限公式列的应用记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(t),g(\\varphi),g(s)\">\\(g(t),g(\\varphi),g(s)\\)</span> 分别表示对应带类型编号的应用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[X]\">\\(g[X]\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 分别表示对应带类型编号的像。函数逆、函数限制和函数复合不省略类型嵌入。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ng_L^{\\mathrm{tm}}&amp;\\coloneqq g\\circ\\mathrm{in}_{0,L}:\\mathrm{Term}_L\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\ng_L^{\\mathrm{fm}}&amp;\\coloneqq g\\circ\\mathrm{in}_{1,L}:\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\ng_L^{\\mathrm{seq}}&amp;\\coloneqq g\\circ\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}:\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{decF}_{L,g}&amp;\\coloneqq(g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}})^{-1}:\ng_L^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_L]\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_L\n\\qquad(g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ng_L^{\\mathrm{tm}}&amp;\\coloneqq g\\circ\\mathrm{in}_{0,L}:\\mathrm{Term}_L\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\ng_L^{\\mathrm{fm}}&amp;\\coloneqq g\\circ\\mathrm{in}_{1,L}:\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\ng_L^{\\mathrm{seq}}&amp;\\coloneqq g\\circ\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}:\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{decF}_{L,g}&amp;\\coloneqq(g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}})^{-1}:\ng_L^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_L]\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_L\n\\qquad(g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nc&amp;\\coloneqq c_L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_L(g;e,d)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\n\\land e,d\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\land\\operatorname{dom}(e)=c[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{dom}(d)=g[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\\land g[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\ (e(c(a))=g(a)\\land d(g(a))=c(a)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_L(g)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e,d\\ \\mathrm{GN}_L(g;e,d).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nc&amp;\\coloneqq c_L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_L(g;e,d)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\n\\land e,d\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\land\\operatorname{dom}(e)=c[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{dom}(d)=g[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\\land g[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\ (e(c(a))=g(a)\\land d(g(a))=c(a)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_L(g)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e,d\\ \\mathrm{GN}_L(g;e,d).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>这是有效编号的最低接口，不单独保证句法操作原始递归。原书 pp.9–10 选取更强编号：连接、数词代入、公式/句子识别均原始递归；使用固定点和标准证明算术化的原子在 Hypothesis 另显式固定这一更强编号。旧条目的 Decode 输出句法对象，却直接属于自然数全递归函数类，类型不合；现经 c 数值化。</p>\n<p>带标签表达式的逆像仍是表达式，不能直接充当公式。公式解码现在显式返回公式树；一般有效编号谓词的条件保持不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"ca49afa2dba90443","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-expression]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"ca49afa2dba90443","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 是固定有效有限字母表语言，$\\mathrm{Expr}_L$、公式及项见 [[67-df-expression]]。固定 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的符号编号及有限树编码 $c_L$，下式取 $c=c_L$；$c[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]$ 是递归集合。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 是固定有效有限字母表语言，$\\mathrm{Expr}_L$、公式及项见 [[67-df-expression]]。固定 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的符号编号及有限树编码 $c_L$，下式取 $c=c_L$；$c[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]$ 是递归集合。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,\\mathrm{RecPred}_1$ 见 [[67-df-recursive-function-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"ca49afa2dba90443","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{in}_{0,L},\\mathrm{in}_{1,L},\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}$ 取 [[67-df-expression]]；$g_L^{\\mathrm{tm}},g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}},g_L^{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 是下式定义的带类型编号。$\\operatorname{decF}_{L,g}$ 仅在 $g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N$ 时定义，定义域为 $g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_L]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Expr}_L","display":false},{"tex":"c_L","display":false},{"tex":"c=c_L","display":false},{"tex":"c[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,\\mathrm{RecPred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_L(g;e,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_L(g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{in}_{0,L},\\mathrm{in}_{1,L},\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}","display":false},{"tex":"g_L^{\\mathrm{tm}},g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}},g_L^{\\mathrm{seq}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{decF}_{L,g}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_L]","display":false},{"tex":"g(t),g(\\varphi),g(s)","display":false},{"tex":"g[X]","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\ng_L^{\\mathrm{tm}}&\\coloneqq g\\circ\\mathrm{in}_{0,L}:\\mathrm{Term}_L\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\ng_L^{\\mathrm{fm}}&\\coloneqq g\\circ\\mathrm{in}_{1,L}:\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\ng_L^{\\mathrm{seq}}&\\coloneqq g\\circ\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}:\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{decF}_{L,g}&\\coloneqq(g_L^{\\mathrm{fm}})^{-1}:\ng_L^{\\mathrm{fm}}[\\mathrm{Fml}_L]\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_L\n\\qquad(g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nc&\\coloneqq c_L,\\\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_L(g;e,d)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &g:\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\n\\land e,d\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\land\\operatorname{dom}(e)=c[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{dom}(d)=g[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\\land g[\\mathrm{Expr}_L]\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Expr}_L\\ (e(c(a))=g(a)\\land d(g(a))=c(a)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_L(g)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e,d\\ \\mathrm{GN}_L(g;e,d).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4045,"backlinks":[{"id":"5fa3acf328238c71","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}$ 与 $\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}$ 取 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]；$\\operatorname{decF}_g$ 只是后者的本条缩写，不对带标签表达式编号直接作公式域限制。"},{"id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 和 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)$ 绑定同一有效呈示及表示公式，见 [[67-df-provability-predicate]]；$g(\\bot)$ 是固定矛盾句 $\\bot\\equiv\\neg(0=0)$ 的编码，见 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]。"},{"id":"48c6bd62556aaf70","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 为公理集合，$g$ 为固定有效 Gödel 编号；见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-godel-encoding]]。"},{"id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_A$、$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$、句子和公式取 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]、[[67-df-sentence]]；固定 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的 $g=c_{L_A}$，句子识别、公式构造与序列操作均为原始递归。"},{"id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f78588027495114a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cd71da66769f105b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g$ 是该证明呈示使用的同一编号，见 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]；$\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)$ 取 [[67-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{PrimCon}$ 为下式定义的外部谓词。"},{"id":"4d0a27b2ecdb1499","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $g:\\mathrm{Expr}_{L_A}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N$，满足 [[67-df-godel-encoding]] 的 $\\mathrm{GN}_{L_A}(g)$；$g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}$、$\\operatorname{decF}_{L_A,g}$ 取同一条目。额外要求公式代码集可原始递归判定，公式构造、代入及 [[67-df-translation]] 的 $\\nu$ 在代码上的总化均为原始递归；数值化解码条件为下式定义的 $\\operatorname{CanF}_g\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1$。"},{"id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L$，$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_K$，$p\\in\\mathbb N$；第一行适用于任意 $L,T$，第二行只涉及上项指定的有效实例 $K,E,E_E,g$。公式编号约定取 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]。"},{"id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 是有效一阶语言，$g$ 是固定有效 Gödel 编号，$T$ 是句子集合；见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-godel-encoding]]。"},{"id":"a0cb59478595f5c6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cb812f5c5aa42196","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g:\\mathrm{Expr}_{L_A}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N$ 满足 [[67-df-godel-encoding]] 的 $\\mathrm{GN}_{L_A}(g)$；$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 取 [[67-df-sentence]]。"},{"id":"1b2d614db2eb3b87","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q$ 为 Robinson 算术；取本册强原始递归句法编号和数词代入函数，见 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]。"},{"id":"9ee4c58635b96fc1","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathbb N$ 取 [[67-df-godel-encoding]] 的公式编号；实现序列 $\\Phi$ 的值为句子，故代码序列使用 $g_{L_A}^{\\mathrm{fm}}\\circ\\Phi$。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-godel-encoding]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-godel-encoding]]"}],"outgoing":["a329235da6144513","ca49afa2dba90443","5f966a5415552b4e"]}